---
# GoogleTest's ASSERT_TRUE/ASSERT_FALSE wrap the condition in an
# AssertionResult temporary, which breaks bugprone-unchecked-optional-access's
# dataflow link back to the original has_value()/has_error() call — a
# well-known false positive with this testing framework, not a real risk
# in test code. Everything else still applies (InheritParentConfig).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access
